## What Your Clients Get

-   **Pension-style portfolio design** (public markets + select private/real assets where suitable)
    
-   **Rules-based discretionary execution** and tax-aware implementation
    
-   **Season-aligned guidance** (Sowing, Growing, Harvest, Legacy)
    
-   **Values-forward tools**: the **Family Meeting** and a **5-minute Financial Values Quiz**
    
-   **Clear reporting rhythm** and decisions documented in plain English
    

![Three people, two women and one man, are sitting at a wooden table in a well-lit room with large windows and a bookshelf. They are engaged in a discussion, smiling, with one woman holding a pen and the man having a tablet and a notebook in front of him.](/images/pages/advisor-relationships/01c06f965e-89a281be-9eb2-49a1-9e35-7e6398f26f1c.webp)

![Three adults having a meeting in a cozy, well-lit room with a wooden table, cups, documents, and a tablet.](/images/pages/advisor-relationships/d415856ccb-43b30bec-3a0e-4f85-9882-0d4064fdd3c1.webp)

## What You Get

-   **Licensed trading & rebalancing** within agreed guardrails
    
-   **Model menu + custom within ranges** (liquidity tiers, sizing limits, rebalancing policy)
    
-   **Proposal & IPS templates** and client-ready explainers
    
-   **Quarterly strategy letters** (co-branded)
    
-   **Due-diligence pack** (IC notes, methodology, sample mandate)
    
-   **Operations support** for account opens, transfers, and exceptions
    

**1) Align** – Confirm co-brand usage, service level, fee schedule, and model lineup.

**2) Enable** – We deliver your **Advisor Kit** (deck, one-pagers, IPS template, quarterly letter template, explainer videos, Family Meeting starter pack).

**3) Onboard** – Mandates & KYC, custody setup, transfers, initial allocations, reporting.

**4) Steward** – Rules-based rebalancing, tax-aware adjustments, and quarterly communications; you remain first chair with the client.

